      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T08:18:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I also figured out why I initially failed to reproduce the issue locally. The file the build failed on (build/bobba/RW/ec.RW.elf) is built multiple times: once with gcc and once with clang. At least some of my attempts to reproduce locally only did the gcc build, which happens to succeed with or without the broken patch.",
      "revId": "f10b8d8214d0532c6d6274225fcae38d76c4dd1d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
